WEBVTT

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:06.837
-Ellie!
-Ellie!

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:13.177
We're so sorry.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.971
We shouldn't have left
without saying goodbye.

00:00:15.054 --> 00:00:16.681
You came all the way down here to find us.

00:00:16.764 --> 00:00:17.848
You put yourself in danger.

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:19.642
You didn't think
we could take care of ourselves.

00:00:19.725 --> 00:00:21.477
With good reason.
And you worried about us.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.187
'Cause you really care about us.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.191
Boys, boys, slow down.
I'm the one who should be sorry.

00:00:27.692 --> 00:00:31.445
I was scared of losing you.
I love you guys.

00:00:32.154 --> 00:00:33.531
[straining] We love you too.

00:00:34.115 --> 00:00:35.324
Hey.

00:00:35.408 --> 00:00:36.826
[both gasp]

00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:38.744
You guys actually did it.

00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:40.538
I'm proud of you.

00:00:41.789 --> 00:00:43.124
I never doubted them.

00:00:45.251 --> 00:00:46.877
Okay, I doubted them a little.

00:00:46.961 --> 00:00:49.088
Boys, I didn't know you had it in you.

00:00:49.171 --> 00:00:51.549
Mostly because you act like
total dimwits all the time.

00:00:51.632 --> 00:00:54.802
Aw. I love family reunions.

00:00:54.885 --> 00:00:58.431
But there's no buffet,
so time to head home.

00:00:58.514 --> 00:01:01.225
-About that--
-[Buck] Hello, mates.

00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:04.645
This is Zee. She's a very dear friend.

00:01:04.729 --> 00:01:06.897
It's nice to meet you, Zee.

00:01:06.981 --> 00:01:11.068
The way you took charge out there,
I'd swear you were part possum.

00:01:11.152 --> 00:01:13.195
Actually, she's a zorilla.

00:01:13.279 --> 00:01:15.573
It's like a skunk, only cooler.

00:01:15.656 --> 00:01:19.076
And my name may or may not be Zsa Zsa.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:20.953
[both gasp]

00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:22.246
[laughs]

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.583
We were lucky to have possums
join our superhero squad.

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:27.835
Really? A superhero squad?

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:29.587
She said it. I didn't.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:31.797
You're probably gonna want our autographs.

00:01:31.881 --> 00:01:33.090
-No thanks.
-I'm good.

00:01:33.174 --> 00:01:35.843
Well, now that you've had
your big adventure,

00:01:35.926 --> 00:01:38.471
I suppose you'll be heading back home.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:42.183
After all,
you're probably bored of old Buck

00:01:42.266 --> 00:01:45.478
and his daring, action-packed,
thrill-a-minute lifestyle.

00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:48.898
Uh…Yeah.

00:01:48.981 --> 00:01:52.777
Yeah, I am. Boring. Just so, so bored.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.445
Total snoozefest.

00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:04.205
Actually, the truth is,
Eddie and I have been thinking…

00:02:04.288 --> 00:02:06.874
Which we're slowly getting better at.

00:02:06.957 --> 00:02:08.834
Uh… Yeah.

00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:14.173
The thing is,
we kinda, sorta like it here.

00:02:18.511 --> 00:02:19.762
Eddie, you talk now.

00:02:22.515 --> 00:02:27.228
We wanna stay down here,
but we wanna know that you'll be okay.

00:02:29.772 --> 00:02:33.067
It seems like it was just yesterday
we were kids.

00:02:33.693 --> 00:02:35.778
I thought we'd always be together.

00:02:36.529 --> 00:02:38.531
Are you sure it's what you want?

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.704
Then I'll be fine.

00:02:48.457 --> 00:02:50.751
[cheering] We're staying!

00:02:50.835 --> 00:02:53.587
Oh, magic! [chuckles]

00:02:53.671 --> 00:02:55.923
I've been a loner for too long.

00:02:56.007 --> 00:02:59.343
Zee made me realize
we're all stronger together than apart.

00:02:59.969 --> 00:03:02.763
It's time for me to have a real family.

00:03:02.847 --> 00:03:05.599
-Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:05.683 --> 00:03:07.560
-[Crash] Go, Buck.
-[Eddie] Go, Buck.

00:03:07.643 --> 00:03:09.729
-[Crash] Go, Buck.
-[Eddie] Go, Buck. Yeah.

00:03:09.812 --> 00:03:11.147
[Crash] Buck, Buck, Buck!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:15.568
I can't believe I'm saying this,
but I'm gonna miss you guys.

00:03:15.651 --> 00:03:17.653
Yeah, we'll miss you guys too.

00:03:18.654 --> 00:03:22.199
Yeah, okay. Enough of this lovefest.

00:03:22.742 --> 00:03:25.244
Is that a tear in your eye, Diego?

00:03:25.328 --> 00:03:27.163
No. And it never happened.

00:03:27.246 --> 00:03:29.373
Look at you. You're such a softy.

00:03:33.961 --> 00:03:37.089
[chatter, laughter]

00:03:41.427 --> 00:03:43.346
[giggling]

00:04:10.706 --> 00:04:12.917
Promise me you'll visit all the time.

00:04:13.417 --> 00:04:14.543
We will.

00:04:15.461 --> 00:04:17.171
Especially when we need something.

00:04:43.948 --> 00:04:47.910
[Ellie] Change is scary,
but it is the way of the world.

00:04:47.994 --> 00:04:52.581
And now I realize it can help us grow
into who we're meant to be,

00:04:52.665 --> 00:04:55.209
even if that takes us to new places.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:59.714
The only thing that stays the same
is the love we have for each other.

00:05:00.464 --> 00:05:02.425
That's the thing about a herd.

00:05:02.508 --> 00:05:05.761
You're a part of it,
even when you're apart.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.267
[Manny] Can you believe it?

00:05:11.809 --> 00:05:13.477
-The boys are back.
-[possums laughing]

00:05:13.561 --> 00:05:14.603
Again.

00:05:15.187 --> 00:05:16.689
And they want lunch.

00:05:18.357 --> 00:05:20.151
[giggling]

00:05:27.783 --> 00:05:29.827
♪ I'm a bad boy doing good things ♪

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.829
♪ Got a lemonade with chicken wings ♪

00:05:31.912 --> 00:05:33.914
♪ I wanna cut loose 'cause I can't see ♪

00:05:33.998 --> 00:05:36.459
♪ So I might just cop myself
A chain tonight ♪

00:05:36.542 --> 00:05:38.044
♪ We start, now we can't stop ♪

00:05:38.127 --> 00:05:39.920
♪ I'm a cold guy on a mountain top ♪

00:05:40.004 --> 00:05:42.006
♪ Yeah, yeah
Yung Bae'll make your hairs drop ♪

00:05:42.089 --> 00:05:44.550
♪ So I might just sneak away
Just for a night ♪

00:05:44.634 --> 00:05:46.093
♪ Get your tail to the dance floor ♪

00:05:46.177 --> 00:05:48.179
♪ I said
Get your tail to the dance floor ♪

00:05:48.262 --> 00:05:50.556
♪ Come on, follow along, feel the groove ♪

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.808
♪ There's no one to prove ♪

00:05:52.892 --> 00:05:54.685
♪ Pick a girl, pick a boy ♪

00:05:54.769 --> 00:05:56.646
♪ Spin 'em round like a toy ♪

00:05:56.729 --> 00:05:58.731
♪ Grab 'em hands, pull 'em close ♪

00:05:58.814 --> 00:06:00.900
♪ Push 'em back, do the most, yeah ♪

00:06:00.983 --> 00:06:02.777
-♪ Pick a girl, pick a boy ♪
-♪ Come on, come on ♪

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.654
-♪ Spin 'em round like a toy ♪
-♪ Come on, come on ♪

00:06:04.737 --> 00:06:06.822
-♪ Grab 'em hands, pull 'em close ♪
-♪ Come on, come on ♪

00:06:06.906 --> 00:06:09.533
-♪ Push 'em back, do the most ♪
-♪ Oh, yeah, come on ♪

00:06:09.617 --> 00:06:12.828
[all laughing]

00:06:13.621 --> 00:06:16.082
[laughs] Well, one thing's for certain.

00:06:16.165 --> 00:06:17.541
With those two around…

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:20.252
[as Lefty] …the Lost World
will never be the same.

00:06:20.336 --> 00:06:21.337
Ha, ha, ho!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.672
♪ Do the most, let's go ♪

